      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "(Not perfect for every situation but edible wrappers could actually beef up your next meal)",
          "rhyme": null,
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "You would only want to use the wraps when there's no food associated with the use of the wraps",
          "rhyme": "ap",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "So, uh, some potential uses include, um, wrapping, bulk-packed in a larger package",
          "rhyme": "aZ",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "And in that case, the, the wrap will actually form into a sauce when you cooked your, your meats",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Um, there's also been interest in, um, development of using the wrap and then actually rip up the wrap and consume it that way the next day",
          "rhyme": "E",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "(It's hoped edible wrappers will do a couple of things",
          "rhyme": "iN",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Create a new demand for produce",
          "rhyme": "e",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Stop throwing out as much garbage as they do",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "MF_DOOM"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "And eat more— chitlins)",
          "rhyme": ")",
